Recommends: mp3rgain, fonts-noto-cjk
Description: GUI for mp3rgain - lossless MP3 and AAC volume adjustment
 mp3rgui is a graphical interface for mp3rgain, a modern mp3gain and
 aacgain replacement written in Rust. It adjusts the volume of MP3 and
 AAC files losslessly, without re-encoding, using ReplayGain analysis.
 .
 Features:
  - Drag-and-drop loading of files and folders
  - Track and album gain: ReplayGain 1.0 (default), ReplayGain 2.0
    or EBU R128
  - Albums per folder, by tags, or as a single album
  - Manual and per-channel gain, undo, stored tag inspection
  - Clipping prevention, progress display and cancellation
